    <h1>Tiny House Trailer Size Guide: Length, Width, Height &amp; Weight</h1>
    <p class="lead">Your trailer sets the hard limits of a tiny house on wheels: how wide, how tall, how long and how heavy it can be. Here is how to choose the right tiny house trailer size before you draw a single wall.</p>
